{"5089320":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ONE LAST BEAM","steam_appid":5089320,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5219230],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE LIGHT IS FADING. THE DEAD ARE COMING.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONE LAST BEAM is a dark, objective-driven action roguelite where your flashlight is as important as your weapons. Move through the night, aim the beam independently, and carve a path through relentless zombie hordes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIM THE LIGHT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your flashlight separately from your movement. Read the battlefield, catch threats at the edge of the darkness, and choose your route before the horde closes in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD A DEVASTATING ARSENAL<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Sparks, level up, and combine weapons with passive upgrades. Deploy Molotov cocktails, flare guns, combat drones, electrical fields, shotguns, and evolved weapons to shape every run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RESTORE THE GRID<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the night takes more than killing. Reactivate transformers, defend shrinking zones, endure the Black Fog, complete ambulance missions, and choose rewards that can transform your build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURVIVE UNTIL DAWN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster enemies, elites, and massive bosses push every build to its limit. Keep moving, protect your remaining health, and turn a desperate opening into a devastating late-game assault.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim the light. Build your arsenal. Reach the dawn.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE LIGHT IS FADING. THE DEAD ARE COMING.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONE LAST BEAM is a dark, objective-driven action roguelite where your flashlight is as important as your weapons. Move through the night, aim the beam independently, and carve a path through relentless zombie hordes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIM THE LIGHT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your flashlight separately from your movement. Read the battlefield, catch threats at the edge of the darkness, and choose your route before the horde closes in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD A DEVASTATING ARSENAL<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Sparks, level up, and combine weapons with passive upgrades. Deploy Molotov cocktails, flare guns, combat drones, electrical fields, shotguns, and evolved weapons to shape every run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RESTORE THE GRID<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the night takes more than killing. Reactivate transformers, defend shrinking zones, endure the Black Fog, complete ambulance missions, and choose rewards that can transform your build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURVIVE UNTIL DAWN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster enemies, elites, and massive bosses push every build to its limit. Keep moving, protect your remaining health, and turn a desperate opening into a devastating late-game assault.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim the light. Build your arsenal. Reach the dawn.<\/p>","short_description":"Aim your flashlight. Let your weapons fire. Survive escalating zombie hordes in this objective-driven survivor roguelite. Restore the power grid, evolve your arsenal, and reach dawn—but brighter light attracts more danger.","supported_languages":"English, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5089320\/8c89c491be57b143e987994ce06d28592df5a233\/header.jpg?t=1793734748","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5089320\/f1e5b4b819099e010a2b71df2b26b34f4e8021c0\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793734748","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5089320\/f1e5b4b819099e010a2b71df2b26b34f4e8021c0\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793734748","website":"https:\/\